1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,249
Berani melawan?

2
00:00:02,308 --> 00:00:03,220
Bunuh di tempat!

3
00:00:05,156 --> 00:00:05,824
Ikut mereka.

4
00:00:06,356 --> 00:00:07,290
Kamu bilang apa?

5
00:00:08,092 --> 00:00:09,193
Kalau bertarung di sini,

6
00:00:09,269 --> 00:00:10,589
kamu benar-benar jadi buronan.

7
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:11,481
Aku akan menjemputmu.

8
00:00:14,584 --> 00:00:15,605
Aku jalan sendiri.

9
00:00:17,073 --> 00:00:21,095
Misi wajib: selamatkan Qin Shuang dalam tiga hari.

10
00:00:21,164 --> 00:00:24,990
Gagal: poin suka Qin Shuang jadi nol.

11
00:00:27,049 --> 00:00:28,078
Xu Yan.

12
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,564
Tepati janjimu.

13
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:30,769
Kutepati.

14
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:31,203
Bang petugas,

15
00:00:31,808 --> 00:00:33,088
salinkan satu surat perintahnya untukku.

16
00:00:33,727 --> 00:00:34,773
Tambah satu keping.

17
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,789
Sebelum fajar,

18
00:00:36,098 --> 00:00:37,548
Nona tak pernah melihat saya.

19
00:00:37,619 --> 00:00:38,895
Salinan surat perintah penangkapan,

20
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,307
dibeli pakai uang keluarga Tang.

21
00:00:40,685 --> 00:00:41,349
Kucatat di buku,

22
00:00:41,429 --> 00:00:42,961
bayarnya pelan-pelan.

23
00:00:43,173 --> 00:00:43,532
Oke,

24
00:00:43,742 --> 00:00:44,439
kubayar.

25
00:00:48,725 --> 00:00:49,513
A-Ling?

26
00:00:52,325 --> 00:00:53,075
Mana dia?

27
00:00:53,525 --> 00:00:54,276
Penjara prefektur.

28
00:00:54,374 --> 00:00:55,947
Dalam tiga hari harus diselamatkan.

29
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,595
Dari Liuxi ke sini,

30
00:00:57,668 --> 00:00:58,752
kamu berkuda semalaman?

31
00:00:59,672 --> 00:01:01,171
Biro pengawal mengetuk pintu tengah malam.

32
00:01:01,364 --> 00:01:03,167
Xiaohe kutitipkan ke Kakek Han.

33
00:01:03,274 --> 00:01:03,933
Satu lagi,

34
00:01:04,141 --> 00:01:06,115
orang Ayah di ibu kota mengirim surat.

35
00:01:06,438 --> 00:01:08,311
Wei Shaoqing sebulan lalu

36
00:01:08,595 --> 00:01:10,659
pulang ke ibu kota membawa seorang pelukis.

37
00:01:10,737 --> 00:01:11,401
Pelukis?

38
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,705
Dia mau melukis siapa?

39
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:14,836
Ini salinan surat perintah penangkapan.

40
00:01:16,836 --> 00:01:17,635
Cap ini,

41
00:01:18,306 --> 00:01:18,909
palsu.
